```Title: PowerShell Version 2 Engine Started (raw Sysmon events)```
```ATT&CK: T1689 | Severity: high | Sigma id: 6d0bf0ed-b060-41c7-9fd9-c515476eab0c```
```Data source: Sysmon EventCode 1 (Splunk Add-on for Sysmon). Change index to where your Sysmon data lives.```
```False positives: Legacy scripts that require PowerShell 2.0```
```Suggested ES correlation search: cron */15 * * * *, earliest=-20m@m latest=-5m@m, throttle on the table fields, notable severity high.```
index=sysmon source="XmlWinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1
(Image="*\\powershell.exe" CommandLine IN ("* -version 2*", "* -ver 2*", "* -v 2*"))
| table _time host User ParentImage Image CommandLine
